### 6.1 READY TO ARCHIVE — single owner, subtree/impl verified, no RFC contradiction

*Read-only evidence; RFC 0011 parity/double-run gates remain unverified per repo.*

Table columns: Set | Repos → host
- **apps (4 clean)** | `oosheet`→`oooffice(oooffice)`, `oodeck`→`oooffice`, `oopaint`→`oocanvas`, `oogit-ui`→`oostudio`
- **apps (3 conditional)** | `oonotes`→`oooffice`, `oopdf`→`oooffice`, `oomail`→`oochat` — **blocked pending §4.2/RFC
  amendment** (RFC lists all three canonical)
- **DE (7)** | `oowm`→`oocomp`, `oowall`→`oocomp`, `ooview`→`oofiles`, `ooedit`→`oofiles`, `oolaunch`/`ooshelf`/`ootoast`→
  `oopanel`
- **OS (4 clean)** | `oodnsd`→`oonetd`, `oosvc-mgr`→`ooinit`, `oofs-ext4`→`oovfs`, `oofs-tmp`→`oovfs`
- **OS (2 retarget)** | `oopolicyd`→`oosession`(→`ooauthd` rename rescues it), `oopowerd`→`oodevd` (**non-canonical host** —
  retarget subtree to `oosysbus`/`oohealthd` first)
- **agents (5)** | `ooplanner`→`ooloop`, `ooeval`/`ooevolve`→`ooconsensus`, `ooredteam`→`oofalsify`, `oorelease`→`oogovern`
- **tools (1)** | `oollama`→`oollama` (the only correct catalog absence)
